10 REM = 深拷贝；m= 转移所有权；f= 只在当前块内借用。
20 FOR ENTITY AS Note
30 DIM text AS STRING AS VAR
40 .ENDENTITY
50 SUB main AS PUBLIC AS VOID
60 DIM original AS STRING AS VAR
70 DIM copied AS STRING AS VAR
80 DIM moved AS STRING AS VAR
90 original = "alpha"
100 copied = original
110 copied = "beta"
120 moved m= original
130 PRINT F"copy={copied} moved={moved}"
140 IF moved <> "" THEN
150 DIM view AS STRING AS VAR
160 view f= moved
170 PRINT F"borrow={view}"
180 .ENDIF
190 moved = "gamma"
200 DIM first AS ENTITY AS Note AS VAR
210 DIM second AS ENTITY AS Note AS VAR
220 first.text = "payload"
230 second = first
240 first.text = "changed"
250 PRINT F"entity-copy={second.text}"
260 .ENDSUB
270 CALL main
280 END
